  "findings": [
    "The actual consuming parser is shared by trial and execution; quoted displays and ordered allowmixing are real improvements. However native_container_candidate still requires a package. Root record/struct streams pass the class parser but fall through the legacy score to Sequence, contradicting complete-command factory ownership.",
